<title>HONG KONG: DBS Land unit to launch HK$1 bln loan.</title>
<headline>DBS Land unit to launch HK$1 bln loan.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1997-05-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>Hua Rui Investments Ltd, a unit of DBS Land, is about to launch a HK$1.0 billion revolving credit facility, bankers said.</p>
<p>The deal will be guaranteed by DBS Land.</p>
<p>They said the facility will have a maturity of three years. With fees, the all-in return to top-tier managers is expected to be 35 to 38 basis points over the Hong Kong Interbank Offered Rate.</p>
<p>The Singapore branch of Sanwa Bank and Sumitomo Bank are tipped as arrangers for the transaction.</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong Newsroom (852) 2843 6960</p>
</text>
